WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:04.133
LOKI
We have a saying in Asgard.

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:07.550
Where there are wolf's ears,
wolf's teeth are near.

00:00:08.727 --> 00:00:09.727
It's a trap.

00:00:13.584 --> 00:00:15.792
MOBIUS
He's lying. Just playing games.

00:00:15.801 --> 00:00:19.176
You had me for
a second, Loki. My ears are sharp too.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.824
♪♪

00:00:22.301 --> 00:00:23.468
MOBIUS
Here's the deal.

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:27.859
Fugitive variant has been
killing our Minutemen.

00:00:29.965 --> 00:00:34.165
We haven't been able to find him,
so let's bring in an expert.

00:00:34.619 --> 00:00:35.536
LOKI
That's me.

00:00:35.551 --> 00:00:37.927
MOBIUS
The criminal could be anywhere, anytime.

00:00:42.301 --> 00:00:43.426
MOBIUS
We gotta be careful.

00:00:43.426 --> 00:00:45.551
Anything we do can
impact the course of history.

00:00:45.535 --> 00:00:47.699
Do you get that?
Loki! Loki!

00:00:48.129 --> 00:00:49.329
[Volcano explodes]

00:00:51.254 --> 00:00:52.421
LOKI
Right on cue!

00:00:52.415 --> 00:00:54.124
♪♪

00:00:55.861 --> 00:00:57.320
JUDGE RENSLAYER
The timekeepers are monitoring

00:00:57.322 --> 00:00:58.614
every aspect of this case.

00:01:00.369 --> 00:01:02.369
Trusting this man
is not a good idea.

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.900
LOKI
No one bad is ever truly bad.

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.983
And no one good is ever truly good.

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:16.344
SYLVIE
This isn't about you.

00:01:16.369 --> 00:01:17.328
LOKI
Right.

00:01:20.996 --> 00:01:22.080
MOBIUS
Loki, wait!

00:01:22.984 --> 00:01:23.984
♪♪

00:01:30.384 --> 00:01:32.093
MOBIUS
I believe, stupidly...

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:37.873
...you can be whatever you
want to be, even someone good.

00:01:40.579 --> 00:01:41.496
LOKI
By the way, I should have

00:01:41.477 --> 00:01:43.602
an equal amount of security.
This is insulting.

00:01:43.618 --> 00:01:45.244
MOBIUS
You just can't help yourself.

